# `git archive` (the clean-export / hand-off tool) OMITS files with `export-ignore`.
# Belt-and-suspenders: secrets + scratch are already gitignored (so untracked, and a
# `git archive` only ever contains tracked files), but keep them export-ignored in case
# one is ever force-added. `git archive` is the only safe hand-off — a raw `git clone`
# ships everything, including history, so never deliver by handing over the repo.

**/scratch/**            export-ignore
**/settings.local.json   export-ignore
.env                     export-ignore
